      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arkoma%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Arkoma once featured an electric trolley route operated by the Fort Smith Light and Traction Company until 1917.",
